```matlab
eq1 = ap + bq + cr == 28;
eq2 = a + b + c == 10;
eq3 = x == a + 2*b - c/3;
```

3. Use the `solve()` function to find the solutions for "a", "b", and "c":
```matlab
sol = solve([eq1, eq2, eq3], [a, b, c]);
