import RemoveWidows from './RemoveWidows';

const App = () => {
  return (
    <div>
      <RemoveWidows>
        Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed non risus. Suspendisse lectus tortor, dignissim sed, adipiscing nec, ultricies sed, dolor. Cras mattis consectetur purus, sed tincidunt magna aliquet non.
      </RemoveWidows>
    </div>
  );
};

export default App;
```

This utility will automatically adjust the font size to fit the content without creating a widow. You can customize the font size by adjusting the `fontSize` state in the `RemoveWidows` component.

